    lat: 37.7800659,
    lng: -122.4059234,
    type: "open studio",
    tag: "Open Studio",
    desc: "Join Studio O+A for a happy hour in the studio during the crawl. Take a peak behind the curtain, meet other designers, and engage in anevolving dialogue about design. \nAt Studio O+A, we thrive at the intersection of disciplines, where diverse perspectives and crafts come together to shape meaningful experiences. We believe the most impactful ideas emergethrough collaboration\u2014when different voices, practices, and ways of thinking intersect. \nCome be a part of that exchange and help explore what\u2019s next as we collectively shape the future of design.",
